  "scope": "Terminal100 whole-volume exposed development validation; three fitted recipes/five separate inference policies, scalar reporting only. Training curves are native T1 sampled-patch metrics, not full-volume or T2 Dice.",
  "limitations": [
    "One fit per recipe; bootstrap intervals condition on fixed models and reused validation, not training-seed uncertainty or untouched confirmation.",
    "T2 operational filename groups are not verified biological identities. No T2 data entered fitting.",
    "No-drop raw-muted input was absent during training. Muting failure does not prove SSC unused; fusion, normalization/activation and calibration remain alternatives.",
    "DROP paused after38 and NODROP after14/59 completed epochs; native asynchronous/global streams restarted, so trajectories are not fully matched. No SSC4 pause is recorded in the demo metadata.",
    "Native raw-enabled T1 validation uses the training cache; fresh muted preprocessing is not asserted bitwise identical. Approved Direction-only source geometry exceptions retain original index alignment.",
    "Raw-enabled and raw-muted are separate policies for each model; no raw-enabledT1/raw-mutedT2 hybrid policy.",
    "Training histories reuse completed epochs only. The canonical no-drop history excludes two incomplete epoch blocks (14 and59) and the zero-work failed discovery attempt; no unfinished epoch is counted."
